      "policy_quote": "You can only help one user per conversation (but you can handle multiple requests from the same user), and must deny any requests for tasks related to any other user.\n\nBefore taking any action that updates the database (cancel, modify, return, exchange), you must list the action details and obtain explicit user confirmation (yes) to proceed.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "source_id": "h2",
          "quote": "Hi. I need some help with my order, actually with two things. I want to change the delivery address for my laptop to my NYC address, and also update the laptop specs. And, um, I also want to exchange my watch for a different dial color but keep the same leather strap."
        },
        {
          "source_id": "h31",
          "quote": "Yes, that’s all correct. Please go ahead and make those changes for me."
        }
      ],
      "reason": "The assistant did not explicitly confirm the address modification details with the user before proceeding, violating the requirement to obtain explicit user confirmation (yes) before updating the database.",
      "status": "ERROR"
    },
    {
      "target_id": "t1",
      "policy_source_ids": ["q9", "q11", "q12"],
      "policy_quote": "Before taking any action that updates the database (cancel, modify, return, exchange), you must list the action details and obtain explicit user confirmation (yes) to proceed.\n\nFor a pending order, each item can be modified to an available new item of the same product but of different product option. There cannot be any change of product types, e.g., modify shirt to shoe.\n\nThe user must provide a payment method to pay or receive refund of the price difference. If the user provides a gift card, it must have enough balance to cover the price difference.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "source_id": "h28",
          "quote": "For the laptop, the variant with the specs you want (15-inch screen, i5 processor, 256GB SSD storage, space grey color) is available with item ID 2216662955 and price $2520.52."
        },
        {
          "source_id": "h29",
          "quote": "I’d like to use my gift card first for any price difference, and then if there’s still more to pay, please let me know what my options are."
        },
        {
          "source_id": "h30",
          "quote": "Here is a summary of the changes you requested:\n\n2. Modify the laptop specs in order #W3730488 to the variant with item ID 2216662955 (15-inch screen, i5 processor, 256GB SSD storage, space grey color) priced at $2520.52."
        },
        {
          "source_id": "h31",
          "quote": "Yes, that’s all correct."
        }
      ],
      "reason": "While the user confirmed the details in **h31**, the gift card balance ($56.00) is insufficient to cover the price difference for the laptop modification (original price: $2701.89, new price: $2520.52, difference: **-$181.37**, which would actually result in a refund). However, the assistant did not verify the payment method's sufficiency for the watch exchange (price difference: **+$152.16**, since the watch price increases from $1756.00 to $1908.15). The cumulative price difference for both actions was not clarified, and the user's intent to use the gift card first was not explicitly tied to the watch exchange. This violates the requirement to ensure the payment method covers the price difference.",
