      "policy_quote": "Before taking any action that updates the database (cancel, modify, return, exchange), you must list the action details and obtain explicit user confirmation (yes) to proceed.\n\nAn order can only be exchanged if its status is 'delivered', and you should check its status before taking the action.",
      "evidence": [
